OpenFuel — open-source station map

First-party code/documentation: AGPL-3.0-only. Original fictional sample facts/map: CC0-1.0.
Full terms and exclusions: LICENSE.md and LICENSES/.

Imported sources: openfuel-canada-source(1).zip and openfuel-android-prototype-source(1).zip.
The Android files are identical between those inputs. Input SHA-256 hashes and path mappings are
recorded in docs/provenance/inputs.json. The cleaned documentation UI came from the separately
provided openfuel-documentation-review.html; claims about unavailable native source were corrected.

Third-party company names/logos and external artwork retain their owners' rights; no endorsement or
permission is implied. Embedded Lucide-derived icon notices remain in the map source where present.
Declared AndroidX/Compose/Material and other dependencies retain their upstream licences. No font files
or native binaries are included. Imported screenshots are browser design evidence, not native screenshots.

Current station discovery uses real OpenStreetMap data, © OpenStreetMap contributors,
under ODbL-1.0. Canadian city search uses GeoNames under CC-BY-4.0. Monthly reference
statistics come from Statistics Canada table 18-10-0001-01 under its Open Licence.
See packages/data/README.md for required attribution, snapshot dates and transformations.
These data licences remain separate from the AGPL code licence. No station pump prices
are seeded. Community prices are unverified observations, not a licensed live price feed.
Leaflet is bundled with its upstream notice in apps/web/preview/vendor/Leaflet-LICENSE.txt.
MapLibre GL JS 5.24.0 and @maplibre/maplibre-gl-leaflet 0.1.4 are bundled with their notices in the
same folder. The base map style is a fork of OpenFreeMap Liberty (OSM Liberty / OSM Bright, design
CC BY 4.0) recoloured after CARTO's Voyager style (design CC BY 4.0, © CARTO); tiles, fonts and
icons load from OpenFreeMap: © OpenMapTiles, data © OpenStreetMap contributors.
See packages/map-style/README.md.
Historical synthetic fixtures and illustrated geography remain test/design resources.
